      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Governor-General Act 1974	3</p>
      <p>Governor-General Amendment (Salary) Act 2014</p>
      <p>No. 7, 2014</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Governor</i><i>-</i><i>General Act 1974</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 13 March 2014</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act may be cited as the <i>Governor</i><i>-</i><i>General Amendment (Salary)</i><i> Act 201</i><i>4</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <content>
          <p>This Act commences on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedule(s)</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
