          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Governor-General Act 1974</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Section 3</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “394,000”, substitute “425,000”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Transitional</heading>
              <content>
                <p>The amendment made by this Schedule does not have effect during the continuance in office of the person holding office as Governor-General immediately before the commencement of this Schedule.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 27 February 2014</i></p>
